From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:18:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): enumerate archive markers via Storage API
 [daveey]

CI Node 26 uses a Storage implementation with non-enumerable entries. Object.keys inspected methods instead of queued markers, so reload loss notices were not emitted in that environment. Use length/key for both durable and legacy markers; assertions inspect that same standard storage contract. RED: two restart-drop behavior tests fail with the old production enumerator under Node 26. GREEN: all 24 cases in the three CI-failing files pass; renderer tsc and applicable eslint pass.
---
